  "notes": "USAGE:\nA versatile term used across many fields — finance ({分散|ぶんさん}{投資|とうし}), technology ({分散|ぶんさん}{処理|しょり}), and general contexts. As a する verb, it can be both intransitive (things disperse) and transitive with させる (to disperse things).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- リスクの{分散|ぶんさん} (risk diversification)\n- {分散|ぶんさん}{投資|とうし} (diversified investment)\n- {分散|ぶんさん}{処理|しょり} (distributed processing)\n- {注意|ちゅうい}が{分散|ぶんさん}する (attention scatters)",
